    /// edge(s) attached to the node(s) attached to the initial ring of edge(s)
    /// surrounding the queried node(s) will be returned. If the value is set to
    /// '0', any nodes that meet the criteria in `queries` and `restrictions`
    /// will be returned. This parameter is only applicable when querying nodes.
